OL,3,GNEWSAPlastic pellet beach clean-up to
OL,4,Aresume after pause
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clean-up operation to remove plastic
OL,7,Fpellets washed up at an East Sussex
OL,8,Fbeach is to resume next month after a
OL,9,Fpause during the summer.
OL,11,FMillions of pellets, commonly known as
OL,12,Fbiobeads, washed up in Camber Sands,
OL,13,FRye Harbour Nature Reserve and St
OL,14,FMary's Bay after a spill at a Southern
OL,15,FWater treatment works in Eastbourne in
OL,16,FOctober 2025.
OL,18,FSince November, a major clean-up
OL,19,Foperation has taken place involving
OL,20,FRother District Council, Environment
OL,21,FAgency, Southern Water and
OL,22,Fnon-for-profit organisation, Nurdle.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
